  The reel_script says the demand to make all contract workers permanent was 'கோரப்பட்டது' and the minimum wage demand is stated correctly; no invented facts found in that section.
  The caption's 'முழு விவரம்' omits nothing critical, but the reel_script and slides omit the chairman's full name spelling and the fact that the Communist party and unorganised workers' union leaders attended beyond 'பலர்' (only minor).
